    "corrections": "The added fixture initially selected customData on entity kinds whose schema excludes it; allowed editable fields were selected instead. Moving an EVSE preserves an equal reverse index. A second interim full run was stopped before extending the identity-spelling guard; only that identified task test process tree was terminated. Connector selection now includes the EVSE scope and toggles the actual parsed value. The first full run was stopped after the known fixture-scope failure; only its identified test process tree was terminated. Initial existing 157 cases passed; corrected final source passes all 22 kind cases and all 53 new cases, then the complete final regression run."
